---
import PublicLayout from '../components/PublicLayout.astro';

Astro.response.status = 404;
Astro.response.headers.set('X-Robots-Tag', 'noindex, nofollow');
---

<PublicLayout title="404 | 类脑 Odysseia - 道馆挑战" description="未找到请求的页面，请返回道馆首页或重新登录。">
	<main class="public-shell narrow-shell not-found-page">
		<section class="not-found-content" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
			<div class="not-found-mascot">
				<img src="/mascot/annoyed.webp" width="616" height="880" alt="困惑又略带无奈的类脑娘" draggable="false" />
			</div>
			<p class="eyebrow">
				<span class="little-flower" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> 404 · 页面未找到
			</p>
			<p class="not-found-code" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
			<h1 id="not-found-title">您请求的资源并非存在。</h1>
			<p class="not-found-description">
				链接可能已经移动、地址拼写有误，或者它本来就不在道馆书架里。
			</p>
			<p class="not-found-d-meow-note" data-d-meow-ui>
				（顺带一提，旅程的地图上也找不到这一页。）
			</p>
			<div class="not-found-actions">
				<a class="button" href="/">
					返回道馆首页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
				</a>
				<a class="button button-secondary" href="/login">前往登录</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</PublicLayout>

<style>
	.not-found-page {
		display: grid;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.not-found-content {
		max-width: 560px;
	}
	.not-found-mascot {
		margin-bottom: 22px;
	}
	.not-found-mascot img {
		display: block;
		width: 112px;
		height: auto;
		filter: saturate(0.84);
		mask-image: linear-gradient(#000 92%, transparent);
	}
	.not-found-code {
		margin: 14px 0 0;
		color: var(--accent);
		font: italic 400 clamp(54px, 9vw, 84px)/1 var(--dojo-latin);
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
	}
	.not-found-content h1 {
		margin: 12px 0 18px;
		font: 400 clamp(26px, 4.5vw, 38px)/1.55 var(--dojo-serif);
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
	}
	.not-found-description {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 13px;
		line-height: 2;
	}
	.not-found-d-meow-note {
		display: none;
		margin: 12px 0 0;
		color: var(--faint);
		font-size: 12px;
		line-height: 1.9;
	}
	.not-found-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 14px;
		margin-top: 30px;
	}
	.not-found-actions .button {
		margin-top: 0;
	}
</style>
